<section class="section-landing-hero">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="spine-hero-title-block">
      <h1>STYLEGUIDE</h1>
      <p class="spine-hero-meta fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker">&gt;</span> The design language of the archive.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="tagline" style="margin-inline: auto; max-width: 64ch; text-align: center;">
      Type, color, components, and the heuristics that hold them together. Every specimen
      below is rendered with the same classes and tokens the rest of the site uses, so this
