<section class="section-inner" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line);" aria-labelledby="typography">
  <p class="section-label">&gt; 01 / Type</p>
  <h2 id="typography" style="color: var(--fi-cyan); font-family: var(--font-system); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Typography</h2>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--fi-cyan); font-family: var(--font-system); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 0.98; text-transform: uppercase;">A thing documented.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">--font-system &middot; Space Mono &middot; route titles, headlines, default voice</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--fi-gold); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1;">Le Sauvegarder.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">--font-display &middot; Old Standard TT &middot; LE SAUVEGARDER and homepage-landing titles</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.62;">
      Report body copy is set in IBM Plex Sans at the reading measure used across dossiers
      and briefings &mdash; comfortable line length, generous leading, sentence case.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">--font-ui / --font-report-body &middot; IBM Plex Sans &middot; report body copy</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--fi-paper-light); font-family: var(--font-human); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
      Field note, written by hand. Courier Prime carries authored testimony and the human
      voice when green or cyan would over-systematize the copy.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">--font-human &middot; Courier Prime &middot; authored testimony, human voice</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p class="section-label">Recent Work Shelves</p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">.section-label &middot; small green uppercase eyebrow above a section</p>
  </div>

  <div style="padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.62;">
      Inline treatments: a <a href="/styleguide/">primary link</a> in blueprint cyan with its
      underline, and the yellow-green <code style="color: var(--fi-green); font-family: var(--font-system);">::selection</code>
      highlight &mdash; select this text to see the focus color fill behind it.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">a (blueprint, hover &rarr; green) &middot; ::selection (bg --focus) &middot; a:focus-visible (3px cyan outline)</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-inner" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line);" aria-labelledby="color">
  <p class="section-label">&gt; 02 / Color</p>
  <h2 id="color" style="color: var(--fi-cyan); font-family: var(--font-system); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Color</h2>
  <p class="tagline" style="max-width: 64ch;">
    Color is role-based, not decorative. Each token below carries a fixed job across every
    route.
  </p>

  <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4" style="margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none;">
    {% set swatches = [
      { token: "--fi-bg", hex: "#000000", role: "Base archive field, page background" },
      { token: "--fi-surface", hex: "#020617", role: "Panels, ticker beds, shadow interiors" },
      { token: "--fi-cyan", hex: "#22d3ee", role: "System structure: borders, rails, metadata" },
      { token: "--fi-green", hex: "#4ade80", role: "SYSOUT: machine output, caption plates, counts" },
      { token: "--fi-magenta", hex: "#e879f9", role: "Prompt syntax, rare operator marks (sparingly)" },
      { token: "--fi-amber", hex: "#fbbf24", role: "Warning, authored emphasis, warm accent" },
      { token: "--fi-gold", hex: "#f59e0b", role: "LE SAUVEGARDER / MTM title energy, human warmth" },
      { token: "--fi-copper", hex: "#c47a3a", role: "Provenance, source chain, maker plate, custody" },
      { token: "--fi-maroon", hex: "#7f1d1d", role: "À Propos primary accent (provenance)" },
      { token: "--fi-silver", hex: "#c0c0c0", role: "Steel / silver institutional register" },
      { token: "--fi-slate", hex: "#94a3b8", role: "Muted text (--muted)" },
      { token: "--fi-red", hex: "#ff0000", role: "Maple Leaf Rag zone nav mark (❦)" },
      { token: "--fi-paper-light", hex: "#f7f4ef", role: "Readable human text, light paper surface" }
    ] %}
    {% for s in swatches %}
    <li>
      <div style="height: 6rem; width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var({{ s.token }});"></div>
      <div class="pt-2 font-mono text-sm">
        <div style="color: var(--ink);">{{ s.token }}</div>
        <div class="text-fi-slate">{{ s.hex }}</div>
        <div class="text-fi-slate">{{ s.role }}</div>
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
    Semantic aliases sit on top of these raw tokens: --ink (green), --muted (slate),
    --line (cyan), --steel (cyan), --oxide (magenta), --brass (green), --focus (cyan).
    Style new components with the aliases so a route re-theme flows through automatically.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">Route Families</h3>
  <p class="tagline" style="max-width: 64ch;">
    Structure is shared across sibling routes; only the color temperature changes, set by a
    body class.
  </p>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="section-label">L'Œuvre &middot; default</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap" style="gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.6rem 0;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-cyan);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-green);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-magenta);"></span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-ui);">Assembled work. Cyan structure, green SYSOUT, magenta only as prompt syntax or a faint wash. No <span class="font-mono text-fi-slate">body</span> class needed.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="section-label">Le Signal &middot; body.signal-sauvegarder</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap" style="gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.6rem 0;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-gold);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-amber);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-copper);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-green);"></span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-ui);">Human-authored transmission with machine-assisted provenance. Gold titles, amber and copper warm structure, green SYSOUT captions, paper body prose.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.25rem;">
    <p class="section-label">À Propos &middot; body.apropos-provenance</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap" style="gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0.6rem 0;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-maroon);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-silver);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-amber);"></span>
      <span style="display: inline-block; height: 2.5rem; width: 3.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--fi-green);"></span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 64ch; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-ui);">Provenance and institutional context. Maroon primary accent, silver institutional plates, amber warmth, green for confirmed provenance facts.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-inner" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line);" aria-labelledby="components">
  <p class="section-label">&gt; 03 / Components</p>
  <h2 id="components" style="color: var(--fi-cyan); font-family: var(--font-system); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Components</h2>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <p class="fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker">&gt;</span> RECORDS (24)</p>
    <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-fi-slate">.fi-caption-box + .fi-prompt-marker &middot; green SYSOUT label: counts, statuses, declarations &mdash; never prose</p>
  </div>

  <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 1.5rem;">
    <div class="oeuvre-ticker-plate">
      <div class="oeuvre-ticker-label" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker">&gt;</span> L'ŒUVRE / 3 shelves</span>
      </div>
      <div class="oeuvre-ticker" role="list" aria-label="Ticker specimen">
        <span class="oeuvre-ticker-item" role="listitem">
          <span>L'Œuvre / Dossiers</span>
          <strong>24 dossier records</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="oeuvre-ticker-item" role="listitem">
          <span>L'Œuvre / Rapports</span>
          <strong>11 ATLAS reports</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="oeuvre-ticker-item" role="listitem">
